    "detailed_description": "<strong>It's a game where you draw all the cards in the deck.</strong><br><br>1.The deck selection screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/df8eca9f92ec58641b06410b87ef20b2.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>And when you click on a deck, you'll see the deck information as shown below.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/a9c05b441089e00c3d2e6876a17b6749.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>2.The play screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/be26626e14b0a5388447e407b1a8be09.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>When the hearts in the center left disappear, it's game over.<br>And the number above it is the number of cards currently left in the deck.<br><br>Additionally, if you right-click on a card anywhere, a detailed description will appear, as shown below.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/c353b46d516fc0c2b6d91fb796e25e00.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>3.Use a card<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.poster.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.webm?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.mp4?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Drag a card and drop it in the blue area on the right to use it.<br>After playing a card, draw a card so that you have a 2-card hand.<br><br>4.Using with Sets<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.poster.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.webm?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.mp4?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Drag a card and drop it into the red area on the left to set it.<br>Sets don't draw cards, and set cards are destroyed when the number displayed above them reaches zero.<br><br>5.Clear<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/d90338c331c1b6e6be83033405d22640.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Once you've drawn the entire deck, you'll see the next screen, and you're clear!<br><br>There are 10+ decks, with 30+ cards.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>It's a game where you draw all the cards in the deck.</strong><br><br>1.The deck selection screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/df8eca9f92ec58641b06410b87ef20b2.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>And when you click on a deck, you'll see the deck information as shown below.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/a9c05b441089e00c3d2e6876a17b6749.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>2.The play screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/be26626e14b0a5388447e407b1a8be09.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>When the hearts in the center left disappear, it's game over.<br>And the number above it is the number of cards currently left in the deck.<br><br>Additionally, if you right-click on a card anywhere, a detailed description will appear, as shown below.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/c353b46d516fc0c2b6d91fb796e25e00.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>3.Use a card<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.poster.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.webm?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/748a688087e0d622c51b2b7dbc255cba.mp4?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Drag a card and drop it in the blue area on the right to use it.<br>After playing a card, draw a card so that you have a 2-card hand.<br><br>4.Using with Sets<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.poster.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.webm?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/0d1245ca89bbc6419cc14582d4515c30.mp4?t=1714567723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Drag a card and drop it into the red area on the left to set it.<br>Sets don't draw cards, and set cards are destroyed when the number displayed above them reaches zero.<br><br>5.Clear<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897010/extras/d90338c331c1b6e6be83033405d22640.avif?t=1714567723\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Once you've drawn the entire deck, you'll see the next screen, and you're clear!<br><br>There are 10+ decks, with 30+ cards.",
